# Audio Streaming (Android)

Audio is an experimental Camera Stream extension. Require camera and microphone permission, set a non-null PCM `audioCodec`, collect `audioStream` before starting Stream, and use `presentationTimeUs`. Cancel collectors before stopping Camera. MockDeviceKit does not promise deterministic PCM delivery.
